title: Start
---
<<declare $alpha = "a">>
<<declare $zeta = "z">>
<<declare $world__day = 1>>
<<declare $session__flag = false>>
<<declare $ui__language = "en">>
<<set $world__day += 1>>
<<set $session__flag = true>>
<<set $ui__language = "fr">>
Day {$world__day}, language {$ui__language}, defaults {$alpha}{$zeta}.
===
